        contrastRatio 3.07, fontSize 12px/normal weight, expected 4.5:1,
        target ".text-amber-600", element
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400"> — this
        is the exact "First match still wins by account-ID order..."
        explanatory line the task flagged as most likely to fail.

  DARK theme (`document.documentElement.classList.add('dark')`, matching
