    label/list text (amber-300 on composited ~rgb(48,33,32)): 10.71:1 PASS
    small text-xs    (amber-400 on same):                      9.25:1 PASS
    axe-core full-page scan in dark mode: no color-contrast violation on
    the warning block (only two pre-existing, unrelated "Delete account"
    button contrast failures, present in both light and dark and untouched
